  "term": "Luminal",
  "definition": "In this packet, luminal refers to a subtype of breast cancer. The source describes luminal breast cancer in younger patients as tending to show more aggressive tumor behavior and poorer outcomes, with certain genomic changes linked to higher-risk disease.",
